  "modifications": "Merge explicit bilingual translations and Turkish definitions; reverse explicit Turkish translation edges, without pivot translation. Exclude marked inflections, affixes and names where tagged. Normalize NFC and whitespace, deduplicate exact headwords, retain up to 3 short glosses, rank source-supported entries by subtitle frequency (unranked entries follow alphabetically), select 10000. Compound expressions and spelling variants may occur; no fabricated forms, CEFR labels or examples. Not independently teacher-reviewed. Deduplicate capitalization and Russian stress variants; apply explicit editorial corrections for common function words (see importer fix map).",
